  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the work of the Office of the Quartet Representative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to the work of the Office of the Quartet Representative is a component of DFID Staff Secondment to Support the Work of the Office of the Quartet Representative (OQR) in the Occupied Palestinian Territories (OPTs) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;352,944. It works in the following sector(s): Public sector policy and administrative management, Business policy and administration, Civilian peace-building, conflict prevention and resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
